      "body": "GZ-005: freeze the full assigned V1 control-plane interface so later consumers can implement consistent authorization, concurrency, playback and errors.\n\nAdds93 operations,136 schemas,33 bilingual stable errors,920 examples and93 serialized synthetic HTTP pairs. Approval proposals carry complete immutable request intent, with RFC8785/SHA256 reference vectors and carrier-aware idempotency. Safety-extension compatibility values are frozen; assertion reference siblings fail closed. WebAuthn creation and authentication use distinct typed options with canonical Base64url.\n\nActual main prerequisite429a6566d81f128cb618c524ee8dc22faba1c0a4 passed local full527 and push CI629 full527. Original Reservation PR70/lease remain valid; only GZ-005 activation/registered paths change. Prior failures and unstable dirty probes remain explicitly unaccepted in Own Evidence. No runtime cryptographic, browser, POC or full-V1 acceptance is claimed.\n\nActual source 85bd46cfc39fc934c9d43623be09acbb557b6930; tree a9e33bc684f0ba500586064dc705445568537115; soleparent/base429a6566d81f128cb618c524ee8dc22faba1c0a4. Published-source17 checks, full make527, three API checks, independent review and latest same-head CI are pending. GZ-012 will wire API checks into language CI; current governance CI runs its existing527.\n\nRefs #68. Merge only after exact-source gates/review; separate Completion follows actual integration/main acceptance."
